# A card with an address is accepted AS WRITTEN — the client's own rich
# card (photo, labels, phone numbers) is what its owner wants to keep. An
# accepting answer MAY carry a rewrite (@contacts.res.card or
# @contacts.res.vcard) the head commits instead, keeping the client's UID;
# this demo does not need one.
WHEN @contacts.phase == "answer" && @contacts.op == "put" && @contacts.card.addresses.0 =~ /./
  EMIT @contacts.res.ok = true
